QTLs for SSC have previously been reported to be linked to peach LG1, 2, 4, 5, 6 [10, 12, 38, 46, 51, 52]. In apricot, García-Gómez et al. (2019) located the most significant QTLs for SSC in LG4 [16]. Our results showed that QTLs for SSC on LG1, 4, 5, and 6. On LG1, the regions of QTLs for SSC (Pp01:13,177,641.. 15,291,518 and Pp01: 24,241,572.. 24,284,070) were very close to the reported positions for SSC-2007-1 (Pp01: 15,691,351) and SSC-2007-4 (Pp01: 24,175,076), respectively [45]. However, in other linkage groups, the QTL positions of
